WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.201 --> 00:00:02.601
-I'm about to perform
some kid theater,

00:00:02.601 --> 00:00:05.038
but first I need
an acting partner.

00:00:05.038 --> 00:00:06.639
And I couldn't ask for
a better one.

00:00:06.639 --> 00:00:10.543
She's a legendary pop icon
and music superstar!

00:00:10.543 --> 00:00:14.047
Please welcome the one,
the only, Madame X!

00:00:14.047 --> 00:00:23.122
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:23.122 --> 00:00:25.224
Are you kidding?
Are you kidding?

00:00:25.224 --> 00:00:28.127
I bow. I bow!

00:00:28.127 --> 00:00:30.897
I bow down to the queen.

00:00:30.897 --> 00:00:32.298
-Jimmy, stand up.

00:00:32.298 --> 00:00:33.900
-I love you.

00:00:33.900 --> 00:00:35.201
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:35.201 --> 00:00:38.470
Yeah. That's exactly right.
That's exactly right.

00:00:38.470 --> 00:00:40.373
That's exactly right!

00:00:40.373 --> 00:00:43.142
Alright.

00:00:43.142 --> 00:00:46.746
Welcome.
Welcome to the show, Madame X.

00:00:46.746 --> 00:00:48.881
Thank you for doing this.
-Thank you for having me.

00:00:48.881 --> 00:00:50.617
-You have a new movie
out tomorrow

00:00:50.617 --> 00:00:52.685
on Paramount+ called "Madame X."

00:00:52.685 --> 00:00:54.920
And I thought it would be fun
to preview some scenes

00:00:54.920 --> 00:00:56.755
for our audience by acting them
out together.

00:00:56.755 --> 00:00:58.124
But here's the catch.

00:00:58.124 --> 00:01:00.225
The scenes we'll be reading are
not from the actual film.

00:01:00.225 --> 00:01:03.329
Instead they are written by
elementary school kids.

00:01:03.329 --> 00:01:06.366 line:0%
-Which is why I'm wearing
an elementary school dress.

00:01:06.366 --> 00:01:08.734 line:0%
-Yes, of course. I know, I know.
Of course. I got it. I got it.

00:01:08.734 --> 00:01:10.002
I totally got it.

00:01:10.002 --> 00:01:12.604
We gave the kids no direction.
We just said --

00:01:12.604 --> 00:01:15.841
"Madame X" is all we told them
and let them do the rest.

00:01:15.841 --> 00:01:17.843
So it's time for "Kid Theater."
Here we go.

00:01:17.843 --> 00:01:24.016
♪ -Kid theater, kid theater ♪

00:01:24.016 --> 00:01:25.651
-This first one is from Jess.

00:01:25.651 --> 00:01:27.520
She's seven years old.

00:01:27.520 --> 00:01:29.522
Madame X, you'll be playing
the role of Madame X.

00:01:29.522 --> 00:01:32.258
I'll be playing
the role of Denny.

00:01:32.258 --> 00:01:33.993
Higgins will read
the scene descriptions.

00:01:33.993 --> 00:01:35.561
Higgins, set up the scene,
please.

00:01:35.561 --> 00:01:39.065 line:0%
-Denny and Madame X
are at the ice cream place.

00:01:40.866 --> 00:01:44.203 line:0%
-When it's your birthday,
you get free ice cream.

00:01:44.203 --> 00:01:46.506 line:0%
-It's my birthday.

00:01:46.506 --> 00:01:49.408 line:0%
-The ice cream waiter throws
Madame X free ice cream,

00:01:49.408 --> 00:01:54.147 line:0%
and she catches it with one
hand then with two hands.

00:01:54.147 --> 00:01:56.416 line:0%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:56.416 --> 00:01:59.185 line:0%
-Can I have some of
your ice cream?

00:01:59.185 --> 00:02:00.720 line:0%
-Oh.
-Sorry.

00:02:00.720 --> 00:02:02.154 line:0%
-Oh [bleep]
-Wait, no.

00:02:02.154 --> 00:02:03.422 line:0%
[ Laughter ]
That's not in the script.

00:02:03.422 --> 00:02:05.491 line:0%
[ Cymbal crashes ]
That's not in the script at all.

00:02:05.491 --> 00:02:07.727 line:0%
-I know, but I'm holding
two ice cream cones.

00:02:07.727 --> 00:02:10.263 line:0%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:10.263 --> 00:02:14.901 line:0%
Well, maybe I'll give you some
ice cream if you dance for me.

00:02:14.901 --> 00:02:17.202 line:0%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:17.202 --> 00:02:19.505 line:0%
-Denny does a slow dance.

00:02:19.505 --> 00:02:21.473 line:0%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:21.473 --> 00:02:22.575 line:0%
-Come on, baby.

00:02:22.575 --> 00:02:25.345 line:0%
-It is very, very slow.

00:02:25.345 --> 00:02:26.912 line:0%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:26.912 --> 00:02:28.247 line:0%
-Hurry up. It's melting.

00:02:28.247 --> 00:02:30.483 line:0%
[ Slow music plays ]

00:02:30.483 --> 00:02:38.123 line:0%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:38.123 --> 00:02:40.593 line:0%
This dance you're doing
right now, it's too slow.

00:02:40.593 --> 00:02:43.095 line:0%
-Mm-hmm.
-Can you dance faster?

00:02:43.095 --> 00:02:45.765 line:0%
And more normal
and use your hands

00:02:45.765 --> 00:02:49.502 line:0%
and your shoulders
and your chin.

00:02:49.502 --> 00:02:50.636 line:0%
-Chin?
-Chin.

00:02:50.636 --> 00:02:53.506 line:0%
[ Music quickens ]
[ Rhythmic clapping ]

00:02:53.506 --> 00:02:58.378 line:0%
-Denny pretends to be normal
and dances using his hands,

00:02:58.378 --> 00:03:02.815 line:0%
his shoulders, and his chin.

00:03:02.815 --> 00:03:05.218 line:0%
-That's a normal dance.

00:03:05.218 --> 00:03:06.552 line:0%
What are you thinking about

00:03:06.552 --> 00:03:08.054 line:0%
while you're doing
a normal dance?

00:03:08.054 --> 00:03:10.690 line:0%
[ Laughter ]

00:03:10.690 --> 00:03:12.292 line:0%
-Normal stuff.

00:03:12.292 --> 00:03:16.029 line:0%
Pants, bread, numbers, you know.

00:03:16.029 --> 00:03:18.597 line:0%
I don't have to tell you.
-Yes, you do.

00:03:18.597 --> 00:03:20.867 line:0%
Don't talk back to me.
[ Laughter ]

00:03:20.867 --> 00:03:22.601 line:0%
-That's not in
the script at all!

00:03:22.601 --> 00:03:24.937 line:0%
-Yes, it --
[ Laughs ]

00:03:24.937 --> 00:03:29.942 line:0%
But I think that you do have to
tell me because I'm not normal.

00:03:29.942 --> 00:03:30.976 line:0%
[ Laughter ]

00:03:30.976 --> 00:03:32.045 line:0%
That's in the script.

00:03:32.045 --> 00:03:33.279 line:0%
-Yeah, it is actually, yeah.

00:03:33.279 --> 00:03:35.247 line:0%
How can we tell?

00:03:35.247 --> 00:03:36.949 line:0%
-By my dance.

00:03:36.949 --> 00:03:39.552 line:0%
-Madame X does a dance
that's not normal,

00:03:39.552 --> 00:03:41.553 line:0%
and she's eating
her free ice cream.

00:03:41.553 --> 00:03:44.991 line:0%
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:03:44.991 --> 00:03:52.098 line:0%
♪♪

00:03:52.098 --> 00:03:54.766 line:0%
-Alright. Alright. Alright.

00:03:54.766 --> 00:03:56.168 line:0%
Hold on. Hold on now.

00:03:56.168 --> 00:03:57.970 line:0%
Alright, alright, alright,
hold on now.

00:03:57.970 --> 00:03:59.238 line:0%
Alright, very good.

00:03:59.238 --> 00:04:03.409 line:0%
[ Cheers and applause ]
No, no, no, no, no, no!

00:04:03.409 --> 00:04:04.977 line:0%
Alright, okay.

00:04:04.977 --> 00:04:06.512 line:0%
[ Laughter ]

00:04:06.512 --> 00:04:08.914 line:0%
-I'm not done with my dance.
You're censoring me.

00:04:08.914 --> 00:04:10.916 line:0%
-No, I'm not. Never.
I would never.

00:04:10.916 --> 00:04:14.820 line:0%
♪♪

00:04:14.820 --> 00:04:16.522 line:0%
Alright, alright, okay, okay.

00:04:16.522 --> 00:04:18.157 line:0%
Alright, Higgins,
whose line is it?

00:04:18.157 --> 00:04:19.458 line:0%
Whose line is it? Okay.

00:04:19.458 --> 00:04:21.394 line:0%
No, no, no!
-It's your line.

00:04:21.394 --> 00:04:24.330 line:0%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:04:24.330 --> 00:04:25.898 line:0%
Madame Triple X.

00:04:25.898 --> 00:04:27.833 line:0%
-Alright, thank you.
[ Laughter ]

00:04:27.833 --> 00:04:29.434 line:0%
-It's melted.
Here, lick my hand.

00:04:29.434 --> 00:04:33.473 line:0%
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:04:33.473 --> 00:04:35.607 line:0%
-And scene.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:04:35.607 --> 00:04:37.076 line:0%
-Alright. That was great.

00:04:37.076 --> 00:04:38.611 line:0%
Alright. Here we go.
Let's do this.

00:04:38.611 --> 00:04:40.612 line:0%
Alright, that's one.
Alright, let's go.

00:04:40.612 --> 00:04:42.247 line:0%
Now let's do another one.

00:04:42.247 --> 00:04:43.882 line:0%
This was sent by Theodore.

00:04:43.882 --> 00:04:48.087 line:0%
This stars two characters,
Madame X and Stupid Fox.

00:04:48.087 --> 00:04:49.922 line:0%
[ Laughter ]

00:04:49.922 --> 00:04:52.958 line:0%
Do I play Ma--
[ Laughter ]

00:04:52.958 --> 00:04:54.927 line:0%
Okay, here we go.
Higgins, set it up.

00:04:54.927 --> 00:04:57.897 line:0%
-This is the story of Madame X
and her Stupid Fox.

00:04:57.897 --> 00:04:58.964 line:0%
[ Laughter ]

00:04:58.964 --> 00:05:00.800 line:0%
Madame X looks out
over the castle,

00:05:00.800 --> 00:05:03.836 line:0%
waiting for the Stupid Fox.

00:05:03.836 --> 00:05:06.105 line:0%
♪ -I am Madame X ♪

00:05:06.105 --> 00:05:08.808 line:0%
♪ My castle is a wreck ♪

00:05:08.808 --> 00:05:10.142 line:0%
-Come on.

00:05:10.142 --> 00:05:17.183 line:0%
♪ -It was so destroyed by
this old Stupid Fox ♪

00:05:17.183 --> 00:05:18.617 line:0%
[ Laughter ]

00:05:18.617 --> 00:05:21.087 line:0%
♪ I will put him in a timeout ♪

00:05:21.087 --> 00:05:25.024 line:0%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:05:25.024 --> 00:05:26.325 line:0%
Thanks for the vocal support.

00:05:26.325 --> 00:05:28.193 line:0%
-Greetings, Madame X.

00:05:28.193 --> 00:05:31.998 line:0%
It is I, your trusty friend,
Stupid Fox.

00:05:31.998 --> 00:05:33.365 line:0%
[ Laughter ]

00:05:33.365 --> 00:05:36.202 line:0%
-I'm very mad at you,
Stupid Fox.

00:05:36.202 --> 00:05:39.338 line:0%
You left all your stupid toys
all over my beautiful castle.

00:05:39.338 --> 00:05:41.007 line:0%
-I did not.

00:05:41.007 --> 00:05:42.542 line:0%
-Yes, you did. Shut up.

00:05:42.542 --> 00:05:43.876 line:0%
[ Laughter ]

00:05:43.876 --> 00:05:45.377 line:0%
-I did not.
-Shut up.

00:05:45.377 --> 00:05:47.947 line:0%
-I did not.
-Shut up. You did.

00:05:47.947 --> 00:05:51.984 line:0%
Shut up.
-Let us not -- let us not argue.

00:05:51.984 --> 00:05:53.419 line:0%
-I agree.

00:05:53.419 --> 00:05:55.654 line:0%
Arguing is not fun.

00:05:55.654 --> 00:05:59.292 line:0%
I want to have fun, Stupid Fox.

00:05:59.292 --> 00:06:03.462 line:0%
[ Laughter ]

00:06:03.462 --> 00:06:05.531 line:0%
Fun, I say.
-Yeah.

00:06:05.531 --> 00:06:08.968 line:0%
♪ I will put my toys away ♪

00:06:08.968 --> 00:06:12.271 line:0%
♪ I'm sorry I made a mess ♪

00:06:12.271 --> 00:06:14.206 line:0%
♪ I'm just a Stupid Fox ♪

00:06:14.206 --> 00:06:16.842 line:0%
♪ I'm sorry, Madame X ♪

00:06:16.842 --> 00:06:18.477 line:0%
-That's kind of good.
-Not bad?

00:06:18.477 --> 00:06:20.546 line:0%
-That's not bad, actually.
-Thank you.

00:06:20.546 --> 00:06:22.415 line:0%
[ Cheers and applause ]
-That's kind of -- Yeah.

00:06:22.415 --> 00:06:24.550 line:0%
That song was beautiful,
Stupid Fox.

00:06:24.550 --> 00:06:27.286 line:0%
So beautiful that I'm going to
change your name.

00:06:27.286 --> 00:06:30.155 line:0%
-Is my name now Beautiful Fox?

00:06:30.155 --> 00:06:33.158 line:0%
-No.

00:06:33.158 --> 00:06:35.461 line:0%
It's Less Stupid Fox.
-Alright.

00:06:35.461 --> 00:06:38.164 line:0%
There we go, and scene.
[ Laughter ]

00:06:38.164 --> 00:06:42.335
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:06:42.335 --> 00:06:43.969
Thank you to Madame X.
Stick around.

00:06:43.969 --> 00:06:46.239
We're talking to Madonna --
I mean Madame X --

00:06:46.239 --> 00:06:48.074
after the break!
Come on back!

